  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Handelspolitik och dess implementering i Ukraina</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Policy and Practice in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r &#xf6;kad transparens f&#xf6;r Ukrainas handelspolitik och    dess implementering med avseende p&#xe5; WTO och EU. Projektet             implementeras av institutet f&#xf6;r ekonomisk forskning och policy        r&#xe5;dgivning (IER). Detta bidrar till det institutionella samarbetet    mellan Kommerskollegium samt ekonomiministeriets avdelning f&#xf6;r WTO    och handelsskydd, i enlighet med ministeriets beg&#xe4;ran.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of this project is increased transparency   of the Ukrainian trade policy and practice with regards to WTO and    EU.This project is implemented by the Institute of Economic Research  and Policy Consulting, IER. It contributes to the institutional       cooperation between Kommerskollegium and the Department for WTO and   Trade Defence at MoE, as requested by the Ministry.</narrative>
  </description>
